  "scenario": "You are setting up the infrastructure for a secure web application.\n\n1.  **Frontend:** Needs to talk to users, so it goes in a **Public Subnet**.\n2.  **Backend:** Needs to download patches but stay hidden, so it goes in a **Private Subnet** with a **NAT Gateway**.\n\nAs the Cloud Engineer, you must:\n\n1.  Create the **VPC**.\n2.  Create **Subnets**.\n3.  Attach an **Internet Gateway (IGW)** for public access.\n4.  Deploy a **NAT Gateway** for private outbound access.\n5.  Create and associate **Route Tables** to control the traffic flow.\n\n---",
